# Lugh guard policy for any MCP server without a pack of its own.
#   npx -y lugh-lang guard --policy default -- <server command>
#
# Reads run freely. Anything that writes, sends, submits, spends money or runs
# commands asks first. Anything the server marks destructive is refused. Tools
# that carry no annotations count as submit, so they ask.
agent DefaultGuard
  budget calls 500
  policy
    allow read
    ask human before write, send, submit, spend, execute
    deny delete
